      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Senator Robert B. introduced the first Mandarin satsuma oranges to Alabama between 1876 and 1878, sparking a citrus boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
